01:00:18.000 --> 01:00:20.000
Tegeleme ainult vahetu probleemiga.

01:00:20.000 --> 01:00:21.000
Sellega, kuidas sa sured.

01:00:21.000 --> 01:00:23.000
Kas meie eesmärk pole siis
minu elus hoidmine? - Jah,

01:00:23.000 --> 01:00:25.000
